ODg3NzI2MjIzMzUzMTAxMjM5NzM0Njc%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX3VzZXJfdXBsb2FkZWRfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=Q0N0nTUFu6wQ7kNvwFDyPc8&_nc_oc=AdqNtCseX8wqhfY782nSurji4SlRo9F3x9YW7c2T1nm_JYaKIAPzDn8YwWFQb_xLqvY4dpiNDrtkxBS-zHh4S3AB&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna&_nc_gid=9BVEyZDYBu2EC90OJgdaXA&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQQufpvskgazx0HtmlDgyNcFFiudV6O38Ft8kT-zc1t-aw&oe=6AF82936", "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "id": "12", "resolution": "1080x1920"}], "comments": [{"author": "_d1ego13.__", "author_id": "70169229223", "id": "18126681322933171", "text": "Why don't you continue Joel's story?", "timestamp": 1794137318, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "lee_ye._.llin", "author_id": "75495191845", "id": "18073014188764088", "text": "Is a Hellcat 😂😂", "timestamp": 1793509949, "like_count": 10}, {"author": "theyyenvy.janzz", "author_id": "73542257833", "id": "18107848363981766", "text": "\"cats dont kno your name\" sweetie honeyy bby cats dont speak😭😂", "timestamp": 1793484886, "like_count": 244}, {"author": "angel_assassin07", "author_id": "51210653126", "id": "18127886941900269", "text": "Fuck cats don’t know your name CATS DONT TALK 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "timestamp": 1793472473, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "danielscouch", "author_id": "78345847674", "id": "18134038723767982", "text": "no", "timestamp": 1793459343, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "bigsurf677", "author_id": "76687885244", "id": "18141778474532397", "text": "Uhh obviously you should abandon a  cat when its neck stretches 20 miles while eating", "timestamp": 1793363016, "like_count": 109}, {"author": "charlesmiller158", "author_id": "9411020355", "id": "18081726761710100", "text": ">Psalm 38:11 “My friends and companions avoid me because of my wounds; my neighbors stay far away.”\n>Psalm 142:4 “Look to my right and see: no one takes notice of me. I have no refuge; no one cares for my soul.”\n>Psalm 39:2-3 “I was mute and silent, I held my peace to no avail, and my distress grew worse. My heart became hot within me. As I mused, the fire burned; then I spoke with my tongue.”\n>Jeremiah 20:9 “But if I say, “I will not mention his word or speak anymore in his name,” his word is in my soul like a fire, a fire shut up in my bones. I am weary of holding it in; indeed, I cannot.”\n>Luke 9:58 “Jesus replied, ‘Foxes have dens and birds have nests, but the Son of Man has no place to lay his head.’”\n\"If the world hates you, keep in mind that it hated me first. If you belonged to the world, it would love you as its own. As it is, you do not belong to the world, but I have chosen you out of the world. That is why the world hates you.\"—John 15:18-19\n“Even to your old age and gray hairs I am he, I am he who will sustain you. I have made you and I will carry you; I will sustain you and I will rescue you.”—Isaiah 46:4\n>“Answer me, Lord, out of the goodness of your love; in your great mercy turn to me. Do not hide your face from your servant; answer me quickly, for I am in distress. You know how I am disgraced and shamed; all my troubles are before you. Scorn has broken my heart and has left me helpless; I looked for sympathy, but there was none, for comforters, but I found none.”—Psalm 69:17\n“Jesus prayed “Father, I have revealed you to those whom you gave me out of the world. They were yours; you gave them to me and they have obeyed your word. Now they know that everything you have given me comes from you. For I gave them the words you gave me and they accepted them. They knew with certainty that I came from you, and they believed that you sent me. I pray for them. I am not praying for the world, but for those you have given me, for they are yours. All I have is yours, and all you have is mine. Your glory has come to me through them. Righteous Father, protect them by the power of your name, the name you gave me, so that they may be one as we are one.””", "timestamp": 1793283942, "like_count": 20}, {"author": "veyl4n", "author_id": "16029606303", "id": "18433568785150464", "text": "Someone pls tag me when train apocalypse story pt.2 drops", "timestamp": 1793254444, "like_count": 29}, {"author": "janine_dijkman", "author_id": "3683158104", "id": "17913209286518521", "text": "Welp I’m never going back there, and setting that house on fire to", "timestamp": 1793234060, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "sxhil.png", "author_id": "39857213246", "id": "18123762688934888", "text": "Wtf Stockholm????", "timestamp": 1793222480, "like_count": 4}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/De_T9oaNGJO/", "webpage_url_basename": "De_T9oaNGJO", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/870481635_2335310127306800_6414063773739778175_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAxNzAxNzE5MDc5ODg3NzI2MjIzMzUzMTAxMjM5NzM0Njc%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX3VzZXJfdXBsb2FkZWRfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=Q0N0nTUFu6wQ7kNvwFDyPc8&_nc_oc=AdqNtCseX8wqhfY782nSurji4SlRo9F3x9YW7c2T1nm_JYaKIAPzDn8YwWFQb_xLqvY4dpiNDrtkxBS-zHh4S3AB&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna&_nc_gid=9BVEyZDYBu2EC90OJgdaXA&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQQufpvskgazx0HtmlDgyNcFFiudV6O38Ft8kT-zc1t-aw&oe=6AF82936", "display_id": "De_T9oaNGJO", "fulltitle": "Video by dayzero.story", "upload_date": "20261027", "epoch": 1794265896, "format": "dash-2335327333971746v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-2335309677306845a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2335327333971746v+dash-2335309677306845a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 681.806, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 609.562, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 72.244, "asr": 44100, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version"